    "scope": "Actual App/Thread/ArtifactPane/OpenedFileView/Workbook components, StrictMode and real parser Worker. Only Tauri IPC/settings/drafts controlled in memory. Source and scenario helper hashes bracket each run.",
    "interactions": [
      "Exact literal, partial-merge D8:E8, cross-window W98:AB103, no-cascade Z101:AC103, blank maximal four cells and whole-sheet coordinates. Selection alone does not create feedback; explicit confirmation stores the exact rectangle.",
      "Partial-merge complete-coordinate disclosure does not enlarge selected range. DOM remains at most2400 cells for huge coordinate declarations; this is a DOM observation, not process/RSS benchmarking.",
      "Hidden interior row22/columnD require unchecked acknowledgement. Coordinates, not hidden values, are shown; showHidden stays false. Editing/reversal and switching actual nonordinal sheet require fresh acknowledgement.",
      "Cold parse of saved raw draft preserves the exact anchor; taking opinion appends to unchanged original composer once and removes only consumed opinion, without dispatch.",
      "Invalid form text holds replacement; once a changed version is observed the existing monitor halts with an explicit reread notice. Canceling the form does not promise automatic retry. Manual reread preserves old opinion and new-version confirmation creates a separate versioned record.",
      "Hide/reopen withdraws old rectangle candidate while preserving the saved opinion.",
      "Separate no-edit journey proves automatic staging retains old grid under inert gate and only reveals new snapshot after actual Worker readiness; keyboard Enter then confirms new-version coordinates.",
      "1280x820 ordinary journeys and900x620 hidden journey keep app/document root bounded with long synthetic composer and opinion form. Pointer clicks and input/button Enter were exercised; this is not an exhaustive keyboard/accessibility audit."
    ],
